description": "This premium lifestyle commercial positions the mug through warm everyday moments, cinematic coffee pours, steam visuals, and natural actor-product interactions across home, car, work, and camping environments. The film focuses on comfort, routine, warmth, and aesthetic living while showcasing the mug’s design, functionality, and premium finish through detailed close-ups and realistic usage moments.\n\nEvery visual, environment, lighting setup, and product interaction is thoughtfully crafted through our proprietary AI-first production pipeline. The ad film also features original music composed specifically for the campaign, helping elevate emotion, mood, and cinematic recall while creating a more immersive brand experience.\n\nPerfect for:\nLifestyle brand campaigns\nDrinkware commercials\nDigital ads and social media\nPremium product storytelling\n\n\nEvery product model, environment, animation, and character is produced using our unique proprietary  AI, CGI, & VFX production pipeline powered by our high-end GPU computers, enabling brands to create high-end appliance ad films without studios, cameras, or live production. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video.\n\n\n🔗 Learn more: https://www.v4b.ai\n📩 Business inquiries: grow@v4b.ai\n\nV4b.ai is an Agency creating Content & Videos Without Any Physical Shoot, using high-end GPU Computers powering CGI, VFX, and AI, operated by specialists. Our production-grade pipelines outperform prompt-based GenAI platforms, delivering cinematic Ad Films, eCommerce Videos, and more from Concept to Final Cut. \n\neCommerce/D2C Listing Videos - Most D2C buyers abandon eCom pages without completing a purchase as they aren’t convinced by images alone. Even before we start production, our AI-powered CGI experts use shared and available product images to create perfect digital double / precise 3D model of client’s product for product accuracy in the final video, then producing Marketplace-Optimized Videos & Images, that increase ‘Add-to-Cart’ by building customer trust, ready to get listed on Amazon, Shopify & more.\n\nFrom Concept to Final Cut, we create Ad Films - Our custom production tech-stack helps our creative team with realistic environments, lifelike AI humans, multi-language voiceovers and dialogues. No sets. No actors. Just Platform-Optimized Films ready for Youtube, Meta, TV, OTT & more.\n\n#AdFilm #CommercialFilm #CoffeeMug #LifestyleCommercial #DrinkwareAd #CinematicAd #AICommercial #CGI #VFX #AIVideo #AIAdvertising #CGIAdvertising #NoShootProduction #WithoutShoot #ProductCommercial #LifestyleFilm #BrandFilm #OriginalMusic #AIMUSIC #CustomMusic #ProductVisualization #3DProductAnimation #VisualStorytelling #PremiumCommercial #DigitalAdvertising #CreativeAdvertising #CommercialDirection #AIContent #CinematicStorytelling #FutureOfAdvertising #AIVideoProductionAgency", "channel_id": "UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "channel_url": "https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCjK5oJeQtU8o7gE89FLAMZw", "duration": 18, "view_count": 29, "age_limit": 0, "webpage_url": "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=7723YfUDjso", "categories": ["Film & Animation"], "tags": [], "playable_in_embed": true, "live_status": "not_live", "media_type": "video", "_format_sort_fields": ["quality", "res", "fps", "hdr:12", "source", "vcodec", "channels", "acodec", "lang", "proto"], "automatic_captions": {"en-orig": [{"ext": "json3", "url": "https://www.youtube.com/api/timedtext?v=7723YfUDjso&ei=FSdWaujsLo6p6dsP_N-uwQ0&caps=asr&opi=112496729&xoaf=5&xowf=1&xospf=1&hl=en&ip=0.0.0.0&ipbits=0&expire=1784056197&sparams=ip%2Cipbits%2Cexpire%2Cv%2Cei%2Ccaps%2Copi%2Cxoaf&signature=4A7B0B683CE3CD2003422E5198FA39839DB87187.31733CE05EA52E15BCABD84F4FBEB4B7012F924E&key=yt8&kind=asr&lang=en&fmt=json3", "name": "English (Original)", "impersonate": true}, {"ext": "srv1"